Subject: [PATCH 1/1] treat pylibxc as independent project2

fit better into upstream Py/CMake system

interp only

upgrade from LOCATION

fine tuning
---
 CMakeLists.txt         | 23 +-------------
 pylibxc/CMakeLists.txt | 70 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 71 insertions(+), 22 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 pylibxc/CMakeLists.txt

